{"id":"n83500-1-10","stage":2,"title":"폭설 · 暴雪","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83500-1-10-1","ko":"엄청나게 눈이 많이 내리네요.","zh":"雪下得真大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄청나게","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청나다：相当，特别；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"엄청나다","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15118","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청나게","audio":"/audio/61d0ca4b3be743e3e473.mp3"}},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"내리네요.","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내리네요","audio":"/audio/d936b3629cd441710683.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d9539274e42f6bfd","term":"엄청나다","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3","entryId":"15118","definition":"量非常多或程度十分严重。","pronunciation":["엄청나다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"01d77617